        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "***SOUTH FACING GARDEN / MATURE ESTATE / GARAGE / 3 BED 2 BATH / SUPERB LOCATION / EXCELLENT TRANSPORT LINKS***\r\n \r\nKELLY BRADSHAW are delighted to present to the market 7 Maywood Park, a wonderful three-bedroom, two-bathroom semi-detached family home with the added benefit of an attached garage, ideally positioned within one of Raheny's most mature and sought-after residential developments.\r\n\r\nFrom the moment you step through the front door, there is an immediate sense of warmth and potential. A welcoming entrance hallway provides a bright introduction to the home, complemented by a convenient guest bathroom on the ground floor. To the front, the spacious living room is filled with natural light and offers the perfect setting to relax and unwind. To the rear, the separate dining room enjoys peaceful views across the beautifully maintained south-facing garden.\r\n\r\nThe kitchen also overlooks the rear garden, allowing you to enjoy the wonderful outdoor setting while preparing meals. A practical utility area is located to the side of the property, while the attached garage provides excellent storage and offers obvious potential for conversion (subject to the necessary planning permission). The garage also provides convenient side access to what is undoubtedly one of the home's standout features.\r\n\r\nThe private south-facing rear garden is a true oasis. Lovingly maintained over the years, it is beautifully landscaped with an abundance of mature shrubs, colourful planting and established greenery, creating a tranquil setting that enjoys sunshine throughout the day. Whether you're enjoying your morning coffee, hosting summer barbecues or simply relaxing outdoors, this wonderful garden offers exceptional privacy and a peaceful retreat rarely found in such a convenient location.\r\n\r\nUpstairs, the accommodation continues to impress with two generous double bedrooms, a comfortable single bedroom and a well-appointed family bathroom. Each room is well proportioned, making this an ideal home for growing families, first-time buyers looking to put down roots, or those seeking to extend and modernise a home in an exceptional location.\r\n\r\nThe attached garage further enhances the appeal of the property, offering valuable storage, secure parking or exciting potential to extend the existing accommodation, as many neighbouring homes within Maywood Park have successfully done over the years (subject to the relevant planning permission).\r\n\r\nThe location is simply second to none. Maywood Park has long been recognised as one of Raheny's most desirable family neighbourhoods, appreciated for its quiet tree-lined streets, generous gardens and outstanding convenience. Residents enjoy easy access to an excellent selection of highly regarded primary and secondary schools, making it an ideal setting for families at every stage of life. Raheny Village is just minutes away, offering an excellent choice of cafés, restaurants, boutiques, supermarkets and everyday amenities, while nearby shopping destinations including Donaghmede Shopping Centre and Northside Shopping Centre provide even greater convenience.\r\n\r\nFor outdoor enthusiasts, the area is truly exceptional. St. Anne's Park, one of Dublin's largest and most beautiful public parks, is just a short distance away and offers scenic woodland walks, sports facilities, playgrounds, the famous Rose Garden and a vibrant weekend market. The stunning coastal walks of Bull Island, Dollymount Strand and the UNESCO-designated Dublin Bay Biosphere are also within easy reach, providing an unrivalled lifestyle for those who enjoy the outdoors.\r\n\r\nConnectivity is another major advantage. Raheny DART Station is within walking distance, providing swift access to Dublin City Centre and beyond, while numerous Dublin Bus routes service the area. The M1, M50, Dublin Airport, Beaumont Hospital and the city centre are all easily accessible, making commuting straightforward whether travelling by car or public transport.\r\n\r\nOffering spacious accommodation, a superb south-facing garden, excellent potential and a location that remains one of North Dublin's most coveted addresses, 7 Maywood Park presents a wonderful opportunity to acquire a forever family home in a mature, established and highly sought-after neighbourhood."
      },
